# 비트코인 주봉 장세 지도 자료(공개 시세 GET 한 번, 주문 없음). minerva-btc-regime.timer가 실행한다.
# 결과: ~/.minerva/btc_regime/regime.json → /api/btc/regime → 🧭 장세 탭
# 설치: sudo cp deploy/minerva-btc-regime.* /etc/systemd/system/ && sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now minerva-btc-regime.timer
[Unit]
Description=Minerva BTC weekly regime map
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ec2-user
WorkingDirectory=/home/ec2-user/work/Minerva
Environment=HOME=/home/ec2-user
ExecStart=/home/ec2-user/work/Minerva/.venv/bin/python -m minerva.btc_regime
Nice=10
MemoryMax=300M
TimeoutStartSec=300
